# 任务状态重启复用记录

时间: 2026-11-12T03:41:31Z
PowerContext: http://127.0.0.1:8000
scope_id: scp_549rm4aaqanj7gjaa3krvga8yw
状态存储: PowerContext（SQLite 持久化）+ seekdb/MySQL sdd_task_state 表

## 1. 从空状态保存任务记录
$ python -m sdd state --task "..." --save --done ... --todo ... --verification ...
{
  "task": "为 TinyCalc 增加 min_value 筛选条件",
  "task_key": "task:46469c3beb700ff6",
  "done": [
    "导入规格与代码",
    "构建开发上下文"
  ],
  "todo": [
    "生成补丁"
  ],
  "verification": [
    "改前目标测试 4 项断言失败"
  ],
  "context_sources": [],
  "patch": "",
  "extra": {
    "loaded_from": "powercontext.memory"
  }
}

## 2. 停止 PowerContext 进程（PID 6240）
$ taskkill /PID 6240 /F
成功: 已终止 PID 为 6240 的进程。
$ curl http://127.0.0.1:8000/health/ready
upstream connect failed: 由于目标计算机积极拒绝，无法连接。 (os error 10061)

## 3. 重新启动 PowerContext（新进程）
$ powercontext server run --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
INFO uvicorn Started server process [<new pid>]
INFO powercontext.server.factory PowerContext Server is ready
$ curl http://127.0.0.1:8000/health/ready
{"status":"ready","checks":{"runtime":"ready","database":"ready","artifact_processing_supervisor":"disabled","access_mode":"disabled","authentication_provider":"disabled","access_provider":"disabled",

## 4. 在新进程上读回状态
$ python -m sdd state --task "..." --show
{
  "task": "为 TinyCalc 增加 min_value 筛选条件",
  "task_key": "task:46469c3beb700ff6",
  "done": [
    "导入规格与代码",
    "构建开发上下文"
  ],
  "todo": [
    "生成补丁"
  ],
  "verification": [
    "改前目标测试 4 项断言失败"
  ],
  "context_sources": [],
  "patch": "",
  "extra": {
    "loaded_from": "powercontext.memory"
  }
}

## 5. 结论
重启后状态完整读回，来源标注 loaded_from=powercontext.memory，
说明状态确实落在 PowerContext 里，而不是留在进程内存或本地文件。
